  Description: "COMPANION / COMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nBasic hits slow ordinary enemies
    for 0.4 seconds.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nRun / Luck: +0.025\nCompanions / Attack
    speed: -0.5%\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces support
    sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nTheir underground library grows books
    from witnessed events, keeping contradictory accounts on adjacent shelves. A
    borrower who never returned left a gap they refuse to fill with a convenient
    ending. They seek the borrower rather than a replacement story.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nEvery
    4s in combat, attempt to heal the hero for 1.5 HP before healing modifiers. Healing
    restrictions apply.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies and absorbed memories; their
    stated percentages are not multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated.
    Listed support modifiers scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: orchard, clover.
    Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment; two equal-species/equal-star bodies
    merge unless the talent forbids it."
